:-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18005","armor":"WP1004505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,69,47,21,55,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18005","armor":"WP1004505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[55,69,47,21,55,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP18005","armor":"WP1004505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏武将，洛阳太守。关羽携刘备二位夫人离开曹营时，途径第二关洛阳关，关卡守将韩福命牙将孟坦诈败，后亲自射击关羽，但关羽无视箭伤，飞马向前将韩福斩杀。","tc":"曹魏武將，洛陽太守。關羽攜劉備二位夫人離開曹營時，途徑第二關洛陽關，關卡守將韓福命牙將孟坦詐敗，后親自射擊關羽，但關羽無視箭傷，飛馬向前將韓福斬殺。","en":"An officer of Cao Wei who served as Governor of Luoyang. When Guan Yu escorted Liu Bei's two wives away from Cao Cao's camp, they passed through Luoyang Pass, the second checkpoint along the route. The garrison commander Han Fu ordered his subordinate commander Meng Tan to feign defeat, then personally shot an arrow at Guan Yu. But Guan Yu ignored the wound and charged forward on horseback, cutting Han Fu down.","jp":"曹魏の武将、洛陽太守。関羽が劉備の二人の夫人を連れて曹営を離れ、第二の関所である洛陽関を通過した際、守将の韓福は牙将の孟坦に命じて偽りの敗走をさせ、自ら関羽を弓で射たが、関羽は矢傷をものともせず、馬を飛ばして韓福を斬り捨てた。","kr":"조위의 무장이자 낙양태수. 관우가 유비의 두 부인을 데리고 조조의 진영을 떠나 두 번째 관문인 낙양관을 지날 때, 관문의 수장 한복은 아장 맹탄에게 거짓으로 패하도록 명한 뒤 직접 관우에게 활을 쏘았다. 그러나 관우는 화살에 맞고도 아랑곳하지 않고 말을 몰아 돌진하여 한복을 베었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10901","remark":"","surname":"韩","surnameTc":"韓","surnameEn":"Han","surnameJp":"韓","surnameKr":"한","surnameOther":"","name":"福","name